config TEST_PSRAM_FULL_CHIP
	bool "Walk the entire PSRAM in the full-memory XIP test"
	help
	  Build test_full_memory_rw_test, which writes and verifies every
	  byte of DT property size (64 MiB on APS512XXN). Leave disabled
	  for functional CI; enable only on bring-up. The sample app
	  (samples/drivers/spi_psram) performs the same full-array walk.

